<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="default">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Polar Snow">
<link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/img/logo.jfif">
<title>เลือกโต๊ะ — Polar Snow</title>
<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
<style>
.table-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }
.table-btn { font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; padding: 28px 0; border-radius: 16px; }
.setup-hint { max-width: 600px; margin: 24px auto 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav class="top-nav"><div class="nav-left"><img src="/img/logo.jfif" alt="Polar Snow Logo"><p class="nav-title">Polar Snow</p></div></nav>
<div class="container text-center py-4">
<h3 class="mb-4">แตะเลขโต๊ะของiPadเครื่องนี้</h3>
<div class="table-grid">
<% tables.forEach(t => { %>
<a href="/menu/<%= t %>" class="btn btn-primary table-btn">โต๊ะ <%= t %></a>
<% }) %>
</div>
<div class="setup-hint alert alert-info">
<b>วิธีล็อกiPadประจำโต๊ะ:</b> แตะเลขโต๊ะ → กด Share → <b>Add to Home Screen</b>
→ เปิดจากไอคอนจะเต็มจอ → เปิด <b>Guided Access</b> ล็อกไว้ที่แอปเดียว
</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
